 Sync sandbox/acastillo/grid with the cleaned upstream patch series while
 preserving sandbox-only compatibility with unmodified $BASILISK:
 
 - Split CUDA MPI halo runtime into cuda/cuda-mpi.c (included from cuda.c)
   and GPU-resident MPI halo exchange into cuda/multigrid-mpi.h (included
   from multigrid-mpi.h), adding sandbox/acastillo/grid/externals.h.
 - Replace mpi_neighbor[6] / mpi_off0..2 / current_mpi_boundary globals
   with MpiOffset, cuda_set_mpi_domain(), periodic_boundary(), and
   mpi->cartcomm; extract choose_mpi_dims(), mpi_wall_mask(),
   mpi_seam_mask(), and gpu_mpi_sync_boundaries().
 - Backport race-free post-kernel gpu_periodic_face_bc(), GLSL FP64 'lf'
   literals and explicit != 0 boolean casts, and floor() in reduction.c.
 - Verified 9/9 on_basilisk/test_multigpu PART_A_TESTS (MPI -np 2,
   STRICT_GPU=1) and 16/16 on_basilisk/test_gpu_fp64 Stage 1 tests against
   pristine upstream Basilisk.
